(function(payload){if(typeof applySerialChapterPayload==="function")applySerialChapterPayload(payload);else (window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE||(window.SERIAL_CHAPTER_QUEUE=[])).push(payload);})({"id":"serial-mystery-76","version":"0a6b940755c1","book":"seventh-wharf","cn":["司机的[[deposition|作证]]从一段很小的记忆开始：[[desolate|荒凉的]]货道，[[despatch|派遣]]单预先[[destine|指定]]校库，他后来接到改线。经理要[[destroy|毁掉]]的是消息以外的手写页。检验[[detector|检测器]]记录了一次[[deviation|偏差]]，不能就让猜测[[devour|吞没]]事实。我们把[[dialog|对话]]与货车[[diary|日记簿]]各存一份，[[diesel|柴油]]气味来自楼外机车。接货员的[[diet|日常饮食]]只有冷面，他以为没人肯等他慢慢说。当老陈把汤端来时，他停下机械似的答话，告诉我们自己曾把漏箱备注撕掉。","这个[[difference|差异]]不因他工作[[diligence|勤奋]]就消失。运输[[director|主管]]借旧手机的[[disappearance|消失]]否认收到警告，却会因这只还在的手机[[disappoint|失望]]。吴老师[[disapprove|不赞成]]把全部错压到接货员，[[discontented|不满的]]司机们则不愿再听基金[[discourse|讲话]]。我们要[[discover|发现]]谁下命令，便让[[discussion|讨论]]停在具体日期。[[disillusion|幻灭]]使人沉默，[[disillusioned|幻想破灭的]]工人也仍要吃饭。接货员把撕掉的纸角拿回来，说那天主管答应先让货走再来补登记，他原想保住月底工资。","登记提取的手机影像存入[[disk|磁盘]]，我对经理的[[dislike|嫌恶]]不能成为拒绝读他解释的理由。他说警告是工人的[[disobedience|不服从]]，会[[displease|使不快]]捐助者。箱数与真实接收的[[disproportionate|不成比例的]]差额，则是一次次[[disruptive|破坏性的]]改线积成。工人表达[[dissatisfaction|不满]]，不是因为好事不能[[dissatisfy|使人不满]]，而是收不到答复。那两种情绪不构成化学鉴定，却给我们找到被删纸角的地方。接货员指着页缝说，这半句话原来就在签字后面，谁签过都应该看见。","从海岛到站的[[distance|距离]]很长，[[distant|遥远的]]办公室却能发一句话让车改路。消息[[distinctly|清楚地]]说‘报损旧件按新器具签’，这样的[[distortion|歪曲]]让批次从退库路线[[diverge|分岔]]。基金声称[[diversify|使多样化]]援助，不能去除我的[[doubt|怀疑]]。窗外一只[[dove|鸽子]]飞过，我们下[[downstairs|楼]]去对磅。经济[[downturn|衰退]]时几十个工人怕失业，主管却让每[[dozen|十二个]]箱只报一箱旧货。老陈用简明[[drawing|图]]标出差数，不是做一张炫耀计算的图，而是让刚才一直被打断的人指着它把事情说完。","秤盘上的水[[drop|滴]]落下，接货员[[dully|迟钝地]]问能否重新写。车站维修组做[[dynamical|动力学的]]复核，不把移动时秤读数当静态重量。工人得[[earn|挣]]生活费，不能因为会算数就一定知道箱里物质。食堂[[earthenware|陶器]]碗摆在桌上，基金关于[[economics|经济学]]效率的海报恰在背后。接货员补写自己的删除过程，具体到用过的剪刀与夹缝，我反而不再需要那张海报里的宏大话。实箱重量与两张原始磅单接上，所谓十套新工具实际只是一只带旧部件的外壳；里面具体物质仍由专业机构检验。","主管远程发来撤线通知，要箱子离开铁路棚送回旧港，理由是这里无法完成清洁。我与何警官核过正式留存要求，站方不会单因基金消息放走被看守的特定箱。可旁边没有被标号的小箱仍在移动，尾签全是教材。程雾从剪掉的纸角认出货车司机另一趟签字，说明主箱之外还有同批次衍生箱。我们不突然宣布所有箱都坏，而把原表尾号逐个比出来，要求站方登记对应实物。叶澄答应回办公室找当年的配件拆分表，吴老师留校核新的接货名单。明天得追清教材尾签指向哪条支路，否则留住一只箱仍会让其余货走回原处。"],"en":["The driver's [[deposition|deposition]] began small: a [[desolate|desolate]] lane, a [[despatch|despatch]] form to [[destine|destine]] goods for school, then rerouting. Management wished to [[destroy|destroy]] handwritten warnings. A [[detector|detector]] recorded [[deviation|deviation]] without letting guesses [[devour|devour]] facts. We separated [[dialog|dialog]] from the vehicle [[diary|diary]]. [[diesel|Diesel]] smell came from a locomotive, not proven contents. Living on a poor [[diet|diet]] of cold noodles, the recipient expected no patient hearing. Chen brought soup; the man finally said he had removed a leak note.","Such a [[difference|difference]] survived claims of [[diligence|diligence]]. A transport [[director|director]] cited a phone's [[disappearance|disappearance]]; its survival would [[disappoint|disappoint]] him. Wu would [[disapprove|disapprove]] of sole blame placed on the recipient. [[discontented|Discontented]] drivers rejected more fund [[discourse|discourse]]. To [[discover|discover]] orders we kept [[discussion|discussion]] to dates. [[disillusion|Disillusion]] silenced workers, yet the [[disillusioned|disillusioned]] still needed food. The man retrieved a torn corner: his supervisor promised registration after departure. He had hoped to preserve his month's pay.","Phone images went onto a registered [[disk|disk]]. My [[dislike|dislike]] could not exclude the manager's account. He called warnings [[disobedience|disobedience]] that would [[displease|displease]] donors. [[disproportionate|Disproportionate]] totals arose through repeated [[disruptive|disruptive]] rerouting. Workers' [[dissatisfaction|dissatisfaction]] concerned unanswered reports, not an inability of good work to [[dissatisfy|dissatisfy]]. Their feelings proved no chemical result, but located missing paper. The recipient indicated the page seam: the deleted warning had followed his signature and ought to have been visible to anyone signing afterward.","Across a great [[distance|distance]], a [[distant|distant]] office ordered change. The message [[distinctly|distinctly]] required damaged old parts signed as new. This [[distortion|distortion]] made batches [[diverge|diverge]] from return routes. Promises to [[diversify|diversify]] aid did not remove [[doubt|doubt]]. A [[dove|dove]] passed as we went [[downstairs|downstairs]] to scales. During [[downturn|downturn]], staff feared job loss; instructions reported only one old box per [[dozen|dozen]]. Chen's [[drawing|drawing]] showed the missing quantities so interrupted workers could point and complete their accounts, rather than display clever calculations.","A water [[drop|drop]] fell onto the pan. [[dully|Dully]], the recipient asked to rewrite his note. Technicians made a [[dynamical|dynamical]] check, distinguishing moving readings from static weight. To [[earn|earn]] wages or understand numbers did not reveal substances. [[earthenware|Earthenware]] lunch bowls stood beneath [[economics|economics]] efficiency publicity. The man documented his deletion, naming scissors and a page seam. Actual weight and original tickets matched: ten supposed tool sets were one casing containing old components. Specialists still needed to identify its substances.","A remote withdrawal ordered return to the old port for cleaning. Station staff followed official retention, not that message. Smaller boxes with textbook labels still moved nearby. Cheng matched another signature on the torn corner, revealing derived boxes in the same batch. We compared suffixes one by one instead of condemning every container. Ye would retrieve the component-splitting sheet; Wu checked school recipients. Tomorrow we needed the textbook labels' branch destinations. Preserving one main box would otherwise leave the rest travelling back toward danger."]});
